# Weekly execution plans, daily briefs/keys & reading summaries.
# Depth-independent on purpose: the month_NN/ archive folders must inherit the same
# exclusions, otherwise archiving a month silently publishes its sealed KEY files.
**/planning/
**/daily/**
!**/daily/**/
!**/daily/**/*_BRIEF.md
!**/daily/**/*_PREDICTIONS_FROZEN.md
!**/daily/**/*HANDOFF*.md
**/ddia_summaries/
**/design/
docs/roadmap/
design/

# Local chat handoffs
*CHAT_HANDOFF*

# Scratch files & test payloads
large*.json
*.jpg
*.png
*.jpeg

# DSA drill scratch (coach compiles probes here, then deletes)
.dsa_tmp/
*.exe

# Career & DSA personal tracking
docs/career/
docs/dsa/
docs/revision/

# Local scratch (disposable experiments)
scratch/

# Engineering blog drafts
docs/blog/



